        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1432_5119.jpg" n="1"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1432_5120.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="1"/>Denen edlen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vesten</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ehrenvesten</unclear>
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear> und weisen Herren
<lb n="3"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Radth der
<lb n="4"/>statt Sant Gallen</orgName> unsern sonders
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstigen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründen</unclear> und
<lb n="6"/>nachpurn.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1432_5121.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="7"/>Edle vesten, auch ersamen fuersichtigen
<lb n="8"/>weisen, besonders guenstige lieben herren, guoten
<lb n="9"/>fruenden und nachburn, E. V. F. W. seyen
<lb n="10"/>unser nachbuerlich fruendtlich guotwillig
<lb n="11"/>dienst und gruoß ieder zeith zuvor
<lb n="12"/>Und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hiebey</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitrath</unclear>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lieber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschworner</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ruodolff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Baur</unclear></persName>,
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hatt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuergebracht</unclear>, das er nun
<lb n="15"/>ettlich zeith, uff unser begeren, seiner
<lb n="16"/>klag und vorderung halb, seines weibs
<lb n="17"/>vatter und muetterlich guot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betreffend</unclear>,
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darumben</unclear> er seinen stieffschwaeher, herrn
<lb n="19"/><persName resp="#ner">Zacharias Kuentzer</persName> inn recht genommen,
<lb n="20"/>mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> geringem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachteil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stillgestanden</unclear>
<lb n="21"/>und sich keines andern versehen, den es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wurde</unclear>
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vertröster</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">massen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">voreröhrter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heüri</unclear>-
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ges</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jhme</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">edlens</unclear>, ein andtwurt
<lb n="24"/>und bscheid erteilt werden, Was E. V. W.
<lb n="25"/>nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mahl</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bemelten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kuenzler</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihne</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angefangnen</unclear> rechten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inzestehennen</unclear>, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ed</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">entschlossen</unclear> und gewiliget seyen, zue-
<lb n="28"/>vermoegen, und uffzeligen,
<lb n="29"/>Weil aber dise handlung lenger, dan er sich
<lb n="30"/>versehen verweilt, hab er fuer sich
<lb n="31"/>selbsten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mehrgedachten</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kuentzer</unclear></persName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">durch</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsern</unclear> stattknecht deß grecht wider ver-
<lb n="33"/>kuenden lassen,
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1432_5122.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Solche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verkündung</unclear> durch ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zedelin</unclear> (wie er berichtet werde)
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mhergesagtem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> durch ein botten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbs</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">überandtwurt</unclear>, welches sonsten, <persName resp="#ner">Hansen</persName>
<lb n="37"/>dem rathsknecht hett sollen zugestelt
<lb n="38"/>werden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burger</unclear> nit
<lb n="39"/>alein dz zedelin Jm zorn und grimen
<lb n="40"/>zurißen, den botten mit fluochen und
<lb n="41"/>schweren, und solchem abtröwen, wen
<lb n="42"/>er mher mit solchen zedlen kome, well er
<lb n="43"/>jhn die stägen znihen abhin schutzen, sonder
<lb n="44"/>auch den g. webern jnn gemein, verächt-
<lb n="45"/>lich, spötlich und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schimpflich</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschwer</unclear>-
<lb n="46"/>worten, daß nicht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachzesagen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anedascht</unclear>.
<lb n="47"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wie</unclear> nun solches von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mhergesagtem</unclear> botten,
<lb n="48"/>so nahe ein stumen, doch zidliche kunsch,
<lb n="49"/>knecht, und andern seines meisters ge-
<lb n="50"/>schäfften nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gen</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">S</unclear>. Gallen</placeName> zogen, dem
<lb n="51"/>rattknecht, vilecht vermein cosens
<lb n="52"/>wegen jhme angeregts zedelin zue ver-
<lb n="53"/>schaffen, angesprochen und erpetten
<lb n="54"/>worden, mit mherem, und alda nit
<lb n="55"/>zemelden, zuo vernemen sein werde,
<lb n="56"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gantz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ernstlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pittend</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">newen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jhne</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andern</unclear>
<lb n="57"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weg</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürderung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rechtens</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußzůspring</unclear>-
<lb n="58"/>ung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sins</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">usstands</unclear> und mangels, damit
<lb n="59"/>er nit verurhsacht, die sach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mherem</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1432_5123.jpg" n="5"/>
<lb n="60"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> begeren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thue</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hilff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear>
<lb n="61"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befuerderung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erteilen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beweisen</unclear>.
<lb n="62"/>Wiewol wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">w</unclear>. die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuerlichen</unclear>
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sachen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">desselben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeheben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolhueldig</unclear> und
<lb n="64"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geneigt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuessen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ohnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jetz</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">be</unclear>-
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ruehrter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Trucker</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuuil</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haß</unclear>
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vnuerschlagig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erschinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Welcher</unclear>
<lb n="67"/>wir doch, ohngedacht des <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Burgers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlegtem</unclear>
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">salzgut</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versumnuß</unclear>, und verachtung, nach
<lb n="69"/>Ihres besten, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wolgedachter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reichtten</unclear>
<lb n="70"/>statt wegen, gantz frueund, und Nach-
<lb n="71"/>puerlich gepetten haben, es wöllen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">e</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">w</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohn</unclear>-
<lb n="72"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unbeschwerlich</unclear> sein, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vßer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iber</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>
<lb n="73"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Juengst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gepflegener</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verrichtung</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemei</unclear>-
<lb n="74"/>nen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verdacht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vffhubs</unclear> wegen,
<lb n="75"/>wie sy Ihres teils, vber wol getzeregten
<lb n="76"/>Nachbuerlich vertrag <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solche</unclear>
<lb n="77"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bfund</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zemachen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ihren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstand</unclear> und
<lb n="78"/>meinung <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vbererclerung</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebend</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vnns</unclear>
<lb n="79"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrifftlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueberichten</unclear> und ze ver-
<lb n="80"/>stendigen, Vnd sonsten, Inn dise,
<lb n="81"/>oder ander weg, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">worinn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iren</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1432_5124.jpg" n="6"/>
<lb n="82"/>in erzeigtem gueten nachbuerlichen willen
<lb n="83"/>gunst und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fruendschafft</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ungern</unclear>,
<lb n="84"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Das</unclear> woellen wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußert</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermuegens</unclear>,
<lb n="85"/>in glichem beschulden und verdienen,
<lb n="86"/>Gottes gnadenrichem segen, unß all
<lb n="87"/>wolbevelchende, Dath <origDate resp="#ner">25 Junii
<lb n="88"/>ao 603</origDate>.
<lb n="89"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-102" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Sattaman und
<lb n="90"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">radth</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Arbon</unclear></orgName>.
</p>
